  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "Not much remains of you, now that the void has devoured you.\n\n\nBut in that devouring, you got rid of your chains, of your masters.\n\n\nPerhaps, now that you are empty and clean, there will be room for me.",
    "Text": "现在虚空已经吞噬了你，你几乎什么都不剩了。\\n\\n\\n但在那吞噬中，你摆脱了你的枷锁，你的主人。\\n\\n\\n也许，现在你已匮净，能让我容身于此。",
    "zh": "现在虚空已经吞噬了你，你几乎什么都不剩了。\\n\\n\\n但在那吞噬中，你摆脱了你的枷锁，你的主人。\\n\\n\\n也许，现在你已匮净，能让我容身于此。",
    "en": "Not much remains of you, now that the void has devoured you.\\n\\n\\nBut in that devouring, you got rid of your chains, of your masters.\\n\\n\\nPerhaps, now that you are empty and clean, there will be room for me.",
    "ja": "Not much remains of you, now that the void has devoured you.\n\n\nBut in that devouring, you got rid of your chains, of your masters.\n\n\nPerhaps, now that you are empty and clean, there will be room for me."
  },
